      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Atomicity is the whole point",
      "items": [
        "A naive GET-then-SET from the app races under concurrent requests",
        "The Lua script runs inside Redis \u2014 atomic in one round trip, no distributed lock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Answer like a public API",
      "items": [
        "200 + RateLimit-Remaining when allowed",
        "429 + Retry-After when denied \u2014 the IETF RateLimit-* headers Stripe and GitHub use"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "GCRA note",
